      <li><a href="/quitclaim-deed/florida/divorce/">Florida Quitclaim Deed for Divorce</a></li>
      <li><a href="/quitclaim-deed/for-divorce/">Quitclaim Deed for Divorce (General Guide)</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Primary Sources -->
  <div class="statute-block">
    <p class="statute-block__label">Primary Sources</p>
    <ul class="statute-block__list">
      <li><a href="https://www.leg.state.fl.us/statutes/index.cfm?App_mode=Display_Statute&amp;URL=0600-0699%2F0689%2FSections%2F0689.01.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Florida Statutes §689.01</strong></a> &mdash; execution and witness requirements</li>
      <li><a href="https://leg.state.fl.us/Statutes/index.cfm/index.cfm?App_mode=Display_Statute&amp;URL=0600-0699%2F0695%2FSections%2F0695.03.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Florida Statutes §695.03</strong></a> &mdash; acknowledgment for recording</li>
      <li><a href="https://www.leg.state.fl.us/statutes/index.cfm?App_mode=Display_Statute&amp;URL=0200-0299%2F0201%2FSections%2F0201.02.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Florida Statutes §201.02</strong></a> &mdash; documentary stamp tax</li>
      <li><a href="https://floridarevenue.com/taxes/taxesfees/Pages/doc_stamp.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Florida Department of Revenue &mdash; Documentary Stamp Tax</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.irs.gov/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed/whats-new-estate-and-gift-tax" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IRS &mdash; Estate and Gift Tax</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="statute-block__note">Last Verified: August 2026. Laws change. Verify current requirements before recording.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="disclaimer-note"><em>This article provides general educational information, not legal, tax, or financial advice. Consult an appropriate professional for advice about a specific transfer.</em></p>
</BaseLayout>

